Subject: Re: point counts and snapshots
Message-ID: <86BxQTJtKtY.CB66p9j49LAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <86BxQTJtKtY._Dy5ig8Pub0J@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
