From: ud718c6bb1db28db2 at groups.google.com (Steve Buckland)
Date: Mon, 10 May 2004 16:59:22 +0000
Subject: Re: bird abundance in numerous discrete patches
Message-ID: <7cs67Kpg3AA.XjWK5SxoOMYJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
